WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.076 --> 00:00:06.358
Ben paused in the hallway to check his class schedule.

2
00:00:06.438 --> 00:00:12.921
His first class was Cooking in room 103.

3
00:00:12.941 --> 00:00:13.461
"Cooking class?"

4
00:00:13.501 --> 00:00:14.021
thought Ben.

5
00:00:14.041 --> 00:00:16.923
"I don't want to learn to cook!"

6
00:00:38.592 --> 00:00:43.674
Around him lockers slammed and feet thudded as other monsters hurried to their classes.

7
00:00:48.756 --> 00:00:49.977
does my eye makeup look?"

8
00:00:51.097 --> 00:00:53.358
Ben heard a purple monster ask a goblin.

9
00:00:53.378 --> 00:00:56.940
"My mom says I put way too much on."

10
00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:01.482
"It looks great," answered the goblin.

11
00:01:01.502 --> 00:01:04.723
"But you missed your fourth eye completely."

12
00:01:11.483 --> 00:01:15.106
Ben sighed and floated down the hall and into room 103.

13
00:01:19.709 --> 00:01:22.111
He saw a zombie sitting alone at a table.

14
00:01:27.596 --> 00:01:28.176
said Ben.

15
00:01:28.196 --> 00:01:29.717
"Can I sit here?"

16
00:01:31.018 --> 00:01:33.120
The zombie stared silently at Ben.

17
00:01:34.421 --> 00:01:35.802
Ben felt uncomfortable.

18
00:01:35.822 --> 00:01:39.325
"Maybe he doesn't like me," he thought.

19
00:01:40.285 --> 00:01:44.589
There hadn't been any zombies at his old school—mostly just other ghosts.

20
00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:47.611
A witch sat down at the table.

21
00:01:48.973 --> 00:01:50.914
Ben recognized her from his homeroom.

22
00:01:52.035 --> 00:01:55.238
She had flowing black hair and was dressed all in black.

23
00:01:56.439 --> 00:01:58.300
Even her fingernails were painted black.

24
00:01:59.641 --> 00:02:01.122
The witch smiled at Ben.

25
00:02:01.143 --> 00:02:05.306
"Zombies just like to stare.

26
00:02:05.846 --> 00:02:07.488
It doesn't mean he doesn't like you."

27
00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.361
"What?" Ben thought, startled.

28
00:02:11.381 --> 00:02:13.722
"How did she know what I was thinking?"

29
00:02:14.742 --> 00:02:15.783
The witch laughed.

30
00:02:16.883 --> 00:02:21.986
"I can't always tell what others are thinking, but sometimes I can.

31
00:02:22.626 --> 00:02:23.106
Have a seat."

32
00:02:27.288 --> 00:02:28.689
Ben thought, sitting down.

33
00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:32.930
He was going to have to watch his thoughts when this witch was around.

34
00:02:34.291 --> 00:02:36.032
Ben sneaked another look at the witch.

35
00:02:37.136 --> 00:02:39.357
Her eyes were green and flecked with gold.

36
00:02:40.498 --> 00:02:43.220
She was the most beautiful witch he'd ever seen.

37
00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:48.803
Just then a huge monster with two sharp horns stalked over to the table.

38
00:02:48.823 --> 00:02:51.404
"Move over!"

39
00:02:51.884 --> 00:02:52.985
he growled at Ben.

40
00:02:53.005 --> 00:02:55.666
"I sit next to Winnie!"

41
00:02:55.686 --> 00:03:03.471
"Chill out, Mog," said the witch, spreading her fingers to admire her nail polish.

42
00:03:04.571 --> 00:03:05.512
Mog ignored her.

43
00:03:06.528 --> 00:03:10.230
He moved his face so close to Ben's that their noses nearly touched.

44
00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.552
"Did you hear me?"

45
00:03:13.112 --> 00:03:13.772
said Mog.

46
00:03:13.792 --> 00:03:16.234
"I said, move over!"

47
00:03:18.215 --> 00:03:19.696
The room was suddenly quiet.

48
00:03:22.417 --> 00:03:24.418
All the other monsters were looking at Ben.

49
00:03:25.519 --> 00:03:28.621
Ben puffed out his chest, trying not to look scared.

50
00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:31.702
"I heard you," he said.

51
00:03:31.722 --> 00:03:34.144
"But I'm not moving."

52
00:03:35.744 --> 00:03:39.066
He glanced at Winnie, who was watching him with a surprised look.

53
00:03:40.287 --> 00:03:44.509
Mog glared at Ben for a few moments.

54
00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:50.073
Finally the big monster grunted and sat down on the other side of Winnie, at the end of

55
00:03:50.113 --> 00:03:50.613
the table.

56
00:03:52.154 --> 00:03:57.297
To Ben's surprise, a ghoul sitting at the next table gave Ben the "claws-up" sign.

57
00:03:58.618 --> 00:04:01.500
A moment later an old witch hobbled into the room.

58
00:04:02.808 --> 00:04:05.951
She wore a crooked purple hat and orange sunglasses.

59
00:04:07.112 --> 00:04:09.013
On her chin was a huge mole.

60
00:04:11.235 --> 00:04:15.618
"She used to be the broom-flying teacher," Winnie whispered.

61
00:04:15.638 --> 00:04:18.500
"My sister had her last year.

62
00:04:19.041 --> 00:04:21.803
She was terrible at flying brooms, though.

63
00:04:22.323 --> 00:04:25.405
So now a new teacher, Miss Bungle, teaches it."

64
00:04:31.432 --> 00:04:34.535
"Good morning, monsters," said the teacher.

65
00:04:34.555 --> 00:04:37.097
"My name is Mrs.

66
00:04:37.177 --> 00:04:40.760
Hag, and I will be your cooking teacher."

67
00:04:41.921 --> 00:04:42.941
Mog groaned.

68
00:04:47.065 --> 00:04:48.326
me!" said Mrs.

69
00:04:48.406 --> 00:04:50.147
Hag, fixing her eyes on Mog.

70
00:04:50.167 --> 00:04:52.569
"Did you have something to say?"

71
00:04:52.589 --> 00:04:55.812
"Yeah," said Mog.

72
00:04:55.832 --> 00:04:58.093
"I hate cooking."

73
00:04:58.113 --> 00:05:02.513
"We actually have something in common," thought Ben.

74
00:05:03.534 --> 00:05:07.417
Mrs. Hag grinned, revealing a row of brown, rotted teeth.

75
00:05:07.437 --> 00:05:12.662
"Well then, Mog, perhaps you'll prefer cleaning.

76
00:05:13.302 --> 00:05:16.505
That will be your job at the end of class."

77
00:05:18.146 --> 00:05:21.069
Mog scowled, and Ben tried not to laugh.

78
00:05:23.972 --> 00:05:24.472
After Mrs.

79
00:05:24.512 --> 00:05:27.595
Hag took attendance, she opened an enormous cookbook.

80
00:05:29.468 --> 00:05:36.034
"For our first cooking lesson, we will make Slimy Toad Stew."

81
00:05:36.054 --> 00:05:41.138
"Yum!" said the ghoul, smacking his lips.

82
00:05:41.158 --> 00:05:46.122
"First we need to gather the ingredients."

83
00:05:46.983 --> 00:05:48.644
Mrs. Hag read from the cookbook.

84
00:05:48.664 --> 00:05:58.162
"Let's see Six rotten eggs, four dried worms, one ounce of bat claws.

85
00:05:58.882 --> 00:06:02.684
Oh, I just bought some bat claws yesterday."

86
00:06:03.904 --> 00:06:05.065
She felt in her pocket.

87
00:06:05.085 --> 00:06:07.586
"I thought I had them with me."

88
00:06:08.746 --> 00:06:12.828
Mrs. Hag searched her other pockets, but she couldn't find the bat claws anywhere.

89
00:06:12.848 --> 00:06:14.649
"Oh, well.

90
00:06:15.089 --> 00:06:19.170
I must have dropped them somewhere," she muttered to herself.

91
00:06:20.431 --> 00:06:23.072
Mrs. Hag opened a cabinet and peeked inside.

92
00:06:24.496 --> 00:06:26.518
"What else can we use?

93
00:06:26.538 --> 00:06:33.442
Aha! These thorns will probably work just as well as bat claws."

94
00:06:34.603 --> 00:06:37.085
The teacher pulled a small bag from the cabinet.

95
00:06:37.105 --> 00:06:45.611
"It says here that these are very special thorns," said Mrs.

96
00:06:45.671 --> 00:06:47.292
Hag as she examined the bag.

97
00:06:47.312 --> 00:06:52.936
"They're from a bush that was grown by the light of the full moon."

98
00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:57.662
"I'm not sure she knows what she's doing," Winnie murmured.

99
00:07:00.124 --> 00:07:03.326
By now some of the monsters in class were starting to doze off.

100
00:07:04.787 --> 00:07:09.130
Ben thought he heard the zombie snoring, but the zombie's eyes were still open.

101
00:07:15.674 --> 00:07:16.695
Ben looked at Winnie.

102
00:07:17.896 --> 00:07:18.696
Winnie shrugged.

103
00:07:18.716 --> 00:07:20.217
"I don't know either.

104
00:07:21.518 --> 00:07:24.020
He might be sleeping, or he might be awake.

105
00:07:24.756 --> 00:07:26.318
It's hard to tell with zombies."

106
00:07:28.761 --> 00:07:33.988
Ben was about to respond when suddenly his stool flew out from under him and across the room!
